"user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-17T20:17:23-07:00","id":630592,"title":"","content":"Well, Demon Storyteller here, so POI is required watching.<br /> <br /> Yes, it gets a story arc, several good ones, but the 4th season is by far the strongest.<br /> <br /> For the last season, I'm hoping for a victory, a definitive ending, but not a happy ending, at least not on a global scale.<br /> <br /> Given who 'meh' people in America are about surveillance, and how content the government is to simply ignore protests or legal challenges, it seems unrealistic to envision an endgame were the world is free of intrusive surveillance, but maybe an ending where Reese and Finch are able to excise at least a few of their personal demons, and The Machine is able to evolve to the point that Samaritan can't destroy it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}